  "summary": "Ukrainian drones attacked Moscow, shutting down all four major airports and prompting evacuations at Sheremetyevo. Russia responded with a large-scale drone and missile wave across Ukraine, employing Geran-5, reactive Shaheds, and new 'Filin' cruise missiles, striking energy facilities in Kyiv, Zhytomyr, and Dnipropetrovsk regions. Russian forces also advanced near Mali Shcherbaky and Shcherbaky on the eastern front.",
  "key_points": [
    "Ukrainian drones attacked Moscow, closing all four airports and forcing evacuations at Sheremetyevo. (Source: @UkraineNow/84854, @UkraineNow/84855)",
    "Russia launched at least 14 Geran-5 drones from Bryansk region toward Rivne region. (Source: @mon1tor_ua/77494)",
    "Russian forces used new 'Filin' cruise missiles capable of ultra-low altitude flight up to 6 km. (Source: @UkraineNow/84847)",
    "Shahed drone hit residential building in Zhytomyr region, injuring nine including two children. (Source: @UkraineNow/84846)",
    "Russian strikes on substations in Orzhiv and Hrabiv caused power outages in Kyiv and Vyshhorod. (Source: @mon1tor_ua/77479, @mon1tor_ua/77487)",
